{
  "description": "Small cases that give each file's content as hex, and the BLAKE3 root of each pack and of each blob, and the root of the whole manifest, so a second implementation checks its hashing as well as its layout. A pack is the contents of its files end to end, with nothing between them. Every entry has mtime_ms 1800000000000. A file's mode is 0o644 and a folder's 0o755 unless the case gives another.",
